  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Star Wars: Echoes of War takes place in the year 4006 BBY, 50 years after the disappearance of Revan. The server follows  the canon ending of Star Wars: Knights of the Old Republic I but does not lead into KOTOR II, instead following it's own timeline. Viscara, the  primary hub planet of the server, finds itself in the unique position of having come out of the war not completely unscathed, but relatively independant, if one considers the control of the Czerka Corporation so. \r\n\r\nThough it sits on a trade route plagued by slavers, the Republic and scattered Sith both are now attempting to consolidate and rebuild, and so both have their eye on currently independant systems they might be able to persuade or coerce to their domain. And still, outside forces such as criminals and other elements unknown look at this wayward Czerka holding with interest, if not outright greed."
    }
  },
